# Pairs with ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeleted. An export of a soft-deleted tree carries no
# row, so every pre-captured key looks deleted. Recovery brings them back, and the
# fabricated tombstones at t then win the ties against them for ever.
MODULE: ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeletedSoftDeleteUnseen
TARGET: ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeleted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the reconcile ignores a soft-deleted source tree, whose export carries nothing
PERTURBS: EndExport

--- FIND
                     /\ ~ex.del0
                     /\ ~deleted
                     /\ delDone = ex.dep0
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the soft-delete state is not consulted.
                     /\ TRUE
--- END
